# Keep Markdown and text files LF in the repository and in every checkout.
# Why: core/Core_Principle.md is declared immutable, and immutability is
# checked by hash. A Windows checkout with CRLF gives a different hash for
# the same text, so the check would fail on one OS and pass on another.
* text=auto
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
